msgid "移动鼠标瞄准，工具会自动连续攻击，无需点击。\n开局有准备时间，瞄准猪后才开始；快速换目标会短暂缓攻。\n空击也消耗体力；将鼠标移出桌面可停止新的攻击。\n\n{0}\n工具升级会提高伤害、范围和体力，技能可叠加。\n当前商店的工具每次攻击均耗能 1。\n护腕共振每局有次数上限，升级后强化效果。\n\n主线共 10 局，每 2 局交租，第 10 局支付最后一笔；按 B 查看账单。\n余额不足则破产，收工后可买装备、学技能。\n中途交租成功后可选能力；第 6 局起加入装甲猪。\n结清房租后进入无尽模式，保留金币和升级，不再收租。"
msgstr "Move the mouse to aim. Your tool attacks automatically.\nAim at a pig after the opening delay. Switching targets briefly pauses attacks.\nMisses cost stamina. Move off the table to stop new attacks.\n\n{0}\nTool upgrades improve damage, range, and stamina. Skill bonuses stack.\nEach shop tool costs 1 stamina per attack.\nCuff pulses are limited per day and get stronger with upgrades.\n\nPay rent every 2 days through Day 10. Press B to view your bills.\nRun out of rent money and the lease ends. Shop and learn skills after work.\nChoose a perk after paying an interim bill. Armored pigs arrive on Day 6.\nPay the last bill to enter Endless Mode with your coins and upgrades."

